{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T02:53:28Z","input_tokens":6310,"cache_read_tokens":97848,"output_tokens":7595,"thinking":"Identified a trailing space in the 우편번호 field at Line 19458, triggering a validation failure. This seems to be a minor whitespace issue that should be cleaned. Suspecting this might be a broader data quality issue, investigation into Line 5435 is warranted. It is necessary to examine the original row in the raw database.\n\n\nIt appears a data entry error occurred at Line 5435, likely involving a copy-paste error where the address was unintentionally replicated across multiple columns. The specific cells impacted range from column 18 to at least column 57 (or potentially column 13 to 57), based on the repeated address data. This is evident from the fact that column 18, which should contain \"주생산품\" also has the address in it.\n\n\nAnalyzing data entry patterns reveals a high input rate for specific fields by a particular operator compared to others, suggesting a focus on detailed data enrichment. The low rate of direct phone call data entry combined with a high rate of DB enrichment implies a strategy of prioritizing data validation and refinement prior to direct contact. Observed variations in date formats and the evolving methodology for handling incorrect business registration numbers indicate potential data source inconsistencies and procedural shifts during the data entry process.\n\n\nA critical data corruption exists at Line 5435, with extensive copy-pasting of address data across numerous columns; the copied data includes the address, \"1-4인\", and \"금속 절삭기계 제조업\". Seven significant single-column errors involve misplaced data like industry descriptions in the establishment date field (Line 5208) and website URLs in the email field (Line 11959). Additionally, noted are 3 instances of typographical errors (\"옮은사업자번호\" instead of \"옳은사업자번호\" and \"패업\" instead of \"폐업\").\